UID:3445489035018041292@strava.com
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20260307T090000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20260307T100000
DTSTAMP:20260226T084329Z
SUMMARY:Saturday Expedition: End to End (and back again) 
DESCRIPTION:Leader: Julie Slack\n\nEnd to End and back again! \n\nOutward o
 ver the peaks and back along lower trails. \n\nThis is a demanding venture 
 and participants need to be regular\, long distance trail runners and be ab
 le to tackle elevation albeit at a walk. \n\nThere will be pauses for photo
 graphy and nutrition and recovery! There might even be a pit stop at the MH
 H jst before the final few kms. \n\nBring food and water for the day and ex
 pect to be out for 5-5.5 hours. \nPlease also carry some basic medical supp
 lies and clothing to appropriate to the day. \n\nParticipants may join for 
 parts of the run but contact Julie to outline your plans and to organise ti
 mes if necessary.  \n\nLiRF: Julie S [Phone Number Redacted]\n\n\nView on S
 trava: https://www.strava.com/clubs/208705/group_events/3445489035018041292
 \n\nSynced from Strava Club 208705 on Thu\, 26 Feb @ 8:43 AM
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:Leader: Julie SlackEnd to End and back again! 
 Outward over the peaks and back along lower trails. This is a demanding ven
 ture and participants need to be regular\, long distance trail runners and 
 be able to tackle elevation albeit at a walk. There will be pauses for phot
 ography and nutrition and recovery! There might even be a pit stop at the M
 HH jst before the final few kms. Bring food and water for the day and expec
 t to be out for 5-5.5 hours. Please also carry some basic medical supplies 
